==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|храмъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{der|ru|cu|храмъ}} via {{inh|ru|orv|храмъ}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*xormъ}}. {{doublet|ru|хоро́мы}} from {{m|orv|хоромъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-храм.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|adj=хра́мовый|dim=хра́мик}}

# [[temple]], [[shrine]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''храм''' [[Артемида|Артеми́ды]] [[эфесский|Эфе́сской]]|the '''Temple''' of Artemis at Ephesus}}
# {{lb|ru|Christianity}} [[church]], [[cathedral]] {{gloss|a place of Christian worship that has an [[altar]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''храм''' [[Василий|Васи́лия]] [[блаженный|Блаже́нного]]|[[:w:Saint Basil's Cathedral|Saint Basil's '''Cathedral''']]}}
# {{lb|ru|also|figuratively|poetic}} [[shrine]]

